					"text" : "The next step is to introduce within the brackets the number of commas you need to nudge the JI pitch with primes greater than 3. Every prime comes with its own comma (see #ji+comma+list). For instance, the 5-limit comma is the syntonic comma (81/80: the difference between a Pythagorean major third and a just major third)",
